{"articleNo":"128186","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=128186&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"외교부 국립외교원 IFANS 공공외교 홍보 프로그램 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.04.28","hit":"2673","attachments":[{"name":"외교부 앱 다운 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=128186&attachNo=73544"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국립외교원 외교안보연구소</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(IFANS)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국민과 함께하는 외교</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 추구하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외교부의 정책 방향에 따라 외교정책이나 주요 국제이슈에 관한 국민의 이해를 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">증진하고 공감대를 형성하기 위해</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, IFANS </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공공외교 홍보 프로그램을 운영하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ㅇ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">IFANS </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공공외교 홍보 프로그램</span></strong></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- IFANS Talks : </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국제이슈에 대한 국민들의 이해 증진을 위해 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">TED(Technology, Entertainment, Design) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">방식의 강연을 매분기 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회 개최</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- IFANS Briefing : </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주요 외교현안 및 연구소 연구 결과 등을 일반 국민이 알기 </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">쉽게 동영상으로 수시 제작</span></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- IFANS Debate : </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국제적 현안에 대해 최고의 전문가들을 모시고 다양한 의견을 격의 없이 나누는 전문가 토론회로 현안발생시 개최</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">상기 프로그램 내용을 동영상으로 제작하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">▲</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">홈페이지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.ifans.go.kr), </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">▲ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국립외교원 유튜브 채널</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.youtube.com/kndalive), </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">▲</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">외교부 및 국립외교원 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">SNS </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">게재</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이와 관련</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 국립외교</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원은 모바일 환경에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">IFANS </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">홍보 프로그램을 보다 쉽게 접할 수 있도록 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">“IFANS Talks </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">스마트폰 앱</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">”</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">을 제작 및 운영</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2013.10</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">하고 있는바</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">많은 학생들의 이용 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><s